Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.21,0:00:03.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.21,0:00:03.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（《现代中文 普通话概论》）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不对 应该这样说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.43,0:00:10.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:14.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:14.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这是在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}学你的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I assumed, as in a number of languages, that the gesture was part of the phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想就跟许多语言一样 手势是表达的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, it's not. -Why am I supposed to know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不是的 -我怎么会知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:28.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As teacher, it's your obligation to separate your personal idiosyncrasies...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:28.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身为老师你有责任撇开个人的表演风格
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:29.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from the subject matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:29.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}认真地教书
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:32.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm glad you decided to learn Mandarin. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:32.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我很高兴你决定学中文 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Once you're fluent, you'll have a billion more people to annoy instead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一旦你能说流利的中文 你就有十亿人可以烦 放我一马
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:39.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:39.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:45.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just called Leonard a syphilitic donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:45.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚说莱纳德是有梅毒的驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.55,0:00:50.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My apologies, Leonard. I'm only as good as my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.55,0:00:50.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 莱纳德 我是跟我老师学的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you learning Chinese?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要学中文？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe the Szechuan Palace has been passing off orange chicken...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信四川皇宫一直把橘子鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:59.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as tangerine chicken, and I intend to confront them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:59.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当成陈皮鸡来卖 我打算跟他们问个清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:03.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I were you, I'd be more concerned about what they're passing off as chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:03.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我是你 会比较担心他们把什么拿来当鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I need to use your window. -Oh, hey. Yeah, no, sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要借用你的窗户 -对 当然 请便
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:14.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, jerk face. You forgot your iPod.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:14.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猪头 你忘了拿随身听
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:18.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's going on? -I'll tell you what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:18.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-发生了什么事？ -我告诉你们发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:22.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That stupid, self-centered bastard wrote about our sex life in his blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:22.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个愚蠢自大的混蛋 把我们的性生活放在了他的博客上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Drop dead, you stupid, self-centered bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去死吧 愚蠢自大的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我们学到哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:40.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not now. I have a blog to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:40.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在不行 我要去找一个博客
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:11.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:11.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:14.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: I'm fine, Leonard. Just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:14.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事 莱纳德 走开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:18.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand that breaking up with someone can be very painful--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:18.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道分手是件痛苦的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:21.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Go away! -Okay, feel better, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:21.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-走开 -好吧 保重 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.15,0:02:27.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She doesn't wanna talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.15,0:02:27.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不想谈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一点都不觉得奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:34.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny's emotional responses originate in the primitive portion of brain, the amygdala.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:34.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮的情绪反应源自于脑部的原始组织杏仁核
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:37.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While speech is centered in the recently developed neocortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:37.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}语言中心在新发展出来的新皮质
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.95,0:02:40.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Former can overpower the latter giving scientific credence...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.95,0:02:40.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}科学证明前者可以压抑后者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to the notion of being rendered speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是所谓的哑口无声
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:51.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or maybe she just doesn't wanna talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:51.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者她只是不想说话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:56.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, look, I found an iPod.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:56.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快看 我捡到一台随身听
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:02.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's smashed beyond repair. What are you gonna do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:02.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被砸烂到没办法修理 你打算拿来干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.31,0:03:06.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What else? Sell it on eBay as slightly used.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.31,0:03:06.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还能干嘛？标明“很少使用”后放到网上卖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was Penny's boyfriend's. They broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是佩妮男朋友的东西 他们分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:13.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, he posted intimate details of their physical relationship on his blog...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:13.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且他把他们的私密肉体关系放在他的博客上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:16.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which I cannot find anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:16.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我到处都找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:20.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I'm gonna go back and try talking to her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:20.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道吗？我要再去跟她谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:23.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good idea. Sit with her, hold her, comfort her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:23.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好点子 跟她一起坐下来 抱着她 安慰她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And if the moment feels right, see if you can cop a feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:25.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果气氛对了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想办法上了她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:31.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not going to do that, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:31.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会那么做 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:35.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not aware of any social convention that requires you to intervene at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:35.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道有任何社会惯例需要你去插手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about damsel in distress?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拯救落难少女？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.43,0:03:41.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Twelfth-century code of chivalry? Not exactly current.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.43,0:03:41.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}十二世纪的骑士精神？现在不流行了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.47,0:03:44.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd also have to be knighted for that to apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.47,0:03:44.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且你还得是骑士才行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care. She's upset, I'm going over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎 她很难过 我要过去看她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:51.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember to sit on your hands a bit so they're warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:51.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记住将手放在屁股下 握起来会比较暖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm her friend. I'm not going to take advantage of her vulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是她的朋友 我不会趁机占她便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:59.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you're saying, if in the depths of despair she throws herself at you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:59.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说如果她绝望到要对你投怀送抱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:03.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and demands you take her right there, right now, you'll just walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:03.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要求你马上占有她 你会拒绝？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:07.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I said I'm her friend, not her gay friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:07.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说我是她的朋友 不是她的男同性恋朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:14.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I know you said you didn't wanna talk--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:14.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你说你不想谈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't. -Okay, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不想谈 -好吧 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Wait. -Wait. Did you say wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等一下 -你说等一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我实话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.39,0:04:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Am I just an idiot who picks giant losers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.39,0:04:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是个老爱上烂男人的白痴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:30.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so I pick good guys, but turn them into losers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:30.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我会爱上好男人 再让他们变成烂男人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:32.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:32.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's gotta be one or the other. Which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原因一定其中一个 到底是哪一个呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:43.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. What were the choices again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:43.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 可以再说一次吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:45.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really thought Mike was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:45.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的以为迈克不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought he was sensitive and smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为他体贴又聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, not you smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不像你那么聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:53.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Normal non-freaky smart. -Yeah, no, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:53.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不像怪胎的普通聪明 -对 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:56.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, and then he just goes and has to humiliate me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:56.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后来他羞辱了我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:05:00.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by writing about me on his blog so the entire world can read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:05:00.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在他的博客写我的事 全世界都看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, it's not all that easy to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上没那么容易找到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:06.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, really? Well, my friends at work found it, my sister found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:06.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？我同事跟姐姐都看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:11.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Judging by my e-mail, a number of prisoners at the Michigan State Penitentiary found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:11.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从我的电子邮件来判断 密歇根州立监狱的囚犯也看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What exactly did this guy write?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这家伙到底写了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:16.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not that I need to know the details of your sex life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:16.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是想知道你的性生活细节
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:17.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just thought....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:17.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:25.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Might as well read it, everybody else has. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:25.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去看吧 反正所有人都看过了 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:28.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, I just feel so betrayed and embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得被背叛了 非常丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:32.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wanna crawl into a hole and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:32.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想钻进洞里死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, you know, this isn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这还不算太糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:41.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It just paints the picture of a very affectionate woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:41.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是在描述一个多情的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:46.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who's open to expressing her affection in nontraditional locales.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:46.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}愿意在非传统的地点表达她的爱意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:48.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:48.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:54.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Elevators, parks, movie theaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:54.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电梯 公园 电影院
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Out of curiosity...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:06:00.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is this subway, the transportation system, or Subway, the sandwich shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:06:00.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是指真的地铁还是三明治店？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:03.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sandwich shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:03.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三明治店
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doesn't that violate the health code or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不会违反卫生法规吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, at the sub shop, we were only making out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我们只是在三明治店亲嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:16.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But my point is that you have absolutely no reason to be embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:16.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的重点是你不必觉得丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Do you think I overreacted?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？你觉得我反应过度吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:23.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Maybe a little. -Because I do that, I do overreact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:23.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-或许有一点 -因为我的确经常反应过度
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:25.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Maybe I should call Mike and apologize. -No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:25.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-或许我该打电话跟迈克道歉 -不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.59,0:06:28.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that would be under-reacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.59,0:06:28.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那是反应迟钝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:32.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He did break the implied confidentiality of the bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:32.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的确违反了闺房保密原则
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.06,0:06:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and in your case, the elevator, parks and fast-food franchise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.06,0:06:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对你们来说闺房是电梯、公园跟快餐店
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:38.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:38.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should just say I am done with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该说我跟他完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes you should. Go ahead, say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你该那么说的 快说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:45.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I never gave the man a chance to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:45.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我没给他机会解释
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:48.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is there to explain? It's all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:48.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有什么好解释的？一切都写在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:53.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you were right the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:53.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 之前你说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:55.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a man who loves me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:55.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个男人爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:07:00.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but in his own stupid way was just trying to show people how he feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:07:00.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他用愚蠢的方式告诉大家他的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:03.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm pretty sure I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:03.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信我没有那么说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:07.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you did better than that. You helped me see it on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:07.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你做得更好 你帮助我看清楚事实
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:13.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where are you going? -I'm going over to Mike's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:13.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要去哪里？ -我要去迈克家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:16.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard, thank you so much. -Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:16.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 谢谢你 -没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:22.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.78,0:07:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe I am her gay friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.78,0:07:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我是她的男同性恋朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, I'm going to need another Mandarin lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 我还得上中文课
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:37.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I obviously didn't make my point with those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:37.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些人没听懂我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:40.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For God's sake, if you don't like tangerine chicken...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:40.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 谢尔顿 如果你不喜欢陈皮鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:42.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...don't order tangerine chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:42.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就不要点陈皮鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like tangerine chicken. I'm just not getting tangerine chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢陈皮鸡 我是吃不到陈皮鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:50.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Can we please change the subject? -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:50.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们能换个话题吗？ -没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:54.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell us again how you screwed up and got Penny back together with her old boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:54.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我们说说你怎么搞砸 让佩妮又回到前男友身边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just roll the dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快丢骰子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:04.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Enslaved by warlocks. Stay here till you roll two, four or--"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:04.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被术士奴役 待在那里 直到你丢出二或四
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was mad at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她本来还在生他的气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was done with him, the relationship was broken...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她跟他早完了 他们的关系破裂到无法挽救
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I walked over there and I fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我却过去帮忙 让他们重修旧好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:17.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, that story gets better every time you hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:17.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 这个故事越听越过瘾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought the first two renditions were far more compelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得前两个版本比较吸引人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:24.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Previously, I felt sympathy for the Leonard character.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之前我还会同情莱纳德这角色
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:27.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now I just find him to be whiny and annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:27.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我只觉得他爱抱怨又讨人厌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:30.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just eat your tangerine chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:30.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃你的陈皮鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd love to, but I don't have tangerine chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很想 但我没有陈皮鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:40.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you so much for your stupid advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:40.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常感谢你的愚蠢建议
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:49.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You managed to screw up the screw-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:49.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能把搞砸的事情再搞砸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:54.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:56.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:56.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry I yelled at you. It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起我对你大叫 那不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:02.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:02.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I went over to Mike's to make up with him--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去迈克家要跟他复合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:08.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, no, I know that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:08.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.55,0:09:10.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But he had already moved on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.55,0:09:10.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他已经重新开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:12.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Already? That was quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:12.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？也太快了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what I said to the woman who had her legs wrapped around his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是那样说的 对用腿夹住他脖子的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:21.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Penny, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:21.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:24.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:24.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他怎么可以这么过分？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:27.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you know, you did throw an 80-gig iPod--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:27.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的确把80G的随身听丢到窗外…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:29.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, no, how could he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:29.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 他怎么可以这么过分？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:33.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I swear to God, I am done with guys like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:33.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对天发誓 我受够了那种男人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:37.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, macho with the perfect body, and the hair and the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:37.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有男子气概 身材好 头发漂亮又有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:40.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that must get old quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:40.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 那样会老得快
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:46.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, just once, I would like to go out with someone who is nice and honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:46.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一次就好 我真的想跟诚实的好人约会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:49.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and who actually cares about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:49.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的关心我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:50.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHIMPERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:54.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:55.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.89,0:09:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CRYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about if you went out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你跟我约会呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you asking me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要约我出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:08.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, yes, I am asking you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:08.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我要约你出去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:12.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was just going off your comment about the nice guy--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是听到你提起好男人…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:16.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, I got that. -And honest--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:16.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 我了解 -老实说…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:18.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, totally. -So but....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:18.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没错 -但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's no big deal. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没什么大不了的 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.25,0:10:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.25,0:10:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I will go out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我愿意跟你约会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:36.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not? I mean, what do I have to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:36.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有何不可呢？我有什么好损失的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:38.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:38.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.31,0:10:42.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.31,0:10:42.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想法不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:48.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Show me your citrus peels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:48.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我看你用的陈皮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:50.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Show me your citrus peels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我看你用的陈皮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:57.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Show me-- -Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-给我看… -谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.87,0:11:02.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:04.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:04.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, do you have a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 你有空吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.71,0:11:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A second what? Pair of underwear?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.71,0:11:10.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}空的什么？空的内裤吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was just wondering if I could talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想跟你谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:14.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's about Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:14.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这跟莱纳德有关
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:17.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why me? Why not Koothrappali or Wolowitz?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:17.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么是我？怎么不找库萨帕里或沃洛维茨？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:20.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Raj can't talk to me unless he's drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:20.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉不能跟我说话 除非他喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Wolowitz is, you know, disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道沃洛维茨很恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Yes, I suppose he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我想是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:30.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I'm saying is you know Leonard the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:30.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说你最了解莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:35.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not necessarily. I'm often surprised by my lack of familiarity with Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:35.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不尽然 我经常感到惊讶 我一点都不了解莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just the other day, I discovered he not only has a loofah, he hides it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那天我发现他不只有丝瓜搓澡巾 还把它藏了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you suppose a man would be ashamed of having a loofah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得为什么男人会为有丝瓜搓澡巾觉得丢脸呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:46.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I myself prefer to have my excess epithelial cells slough off naturally...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:46.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢让多余的角质自然脱落
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:50.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I don't condemn those who seek to accelerate the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:50.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不会谴责希望加速脱落过程的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:55.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And until recently, I had no idea that despite his lactose intolerance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:55.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最近我才知道虽然他有乳糖不耐症
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he can tolerate small amounts of nonfat ice cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他可以吃少量的脱脂冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...without producing a noxious gas...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且不会制造
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:03.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that, I maintain, in the right concentration could be weaponized.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:03.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我坚持只要浓度适当就可以成为致命武器的毒气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:06.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard might come home. Can we talk in my apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:06.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德可能会回家 我们能到我家谈一谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:09.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not done?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:09.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还没有谈完吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:12.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Eh, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:12.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还没 -为什么不呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:15.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're already through the looking glass anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:15.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正都开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:21.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:21.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我想跟你谈这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess you're aware that Leonard asked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜你知道莱纳德约我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:26.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, he didn't actually say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:26.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But when he came back to the apartment, he was doing a dance...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他回家时开心地跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:33.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that brought to mind the happy hippos in Fantasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:33.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我想起《幻想曲》里快乐的河马
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:35.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:35.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:38.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyhow, the thing I wanted to talk to about is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:38.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想谈的是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you know, since Leonard and I have become friends, I was just--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟莱纳德是朋友 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:42.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wanna sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:42.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要坐下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.35,0:12:45.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I wish it were that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.35,0:12:45.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望事情有那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:51.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, I don't spend much time here, and so I've never chosen a place to sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:51.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不常待在这里 所以我还没选好该坐哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快选吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:56.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are a number of options and....
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:56.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里有很多选择
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm really not familiar enough with the cushion densities...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的还不熟悉坐垫密度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:03.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...air-flow patterns and dispersion of sunlight to make an informed choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:03.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}气流模式跟阳光角度来做出正确选择
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:07.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you pick at random, if you don't like it, sit somewhere else next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:07.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你何不随便挑一个地方坐下？ 不喜欢的话 下次再换别的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:09.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:09.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 那跟疯子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:14.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You go ahead and talk while I figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:14.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你继续说吧 我慢慢找
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重点是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:23.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I've known for a while now that Leonard has had a little crush on me--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:23.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我早知道莱纳德有点喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:25.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little crush?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:25.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有点喜欢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:27.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:27.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:31.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the same way Menelaus had a little crush on Helen of Troy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:31.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就跟梅纳雷阿斯劳斯有点喜欢特洛伊的海伦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:33.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't really know who they are--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:33.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道他们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Menelaus was the brother of Agamemnon-- -Yeah, I don't care. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-梅纳雷阿斯劳斯是阿格曼农的兄弟 -我不在乎 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.61,0:13:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The point is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.61,0:13:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重点是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Leonard isn't the kind of guy I usually go out with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德跟我平常交往的男人不同
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:45.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard isn't the kind of guy anyone usually goes out with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:45.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德跟所有人平常交往的男人都不同
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:49.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you be open to rotating the couch clockwise 30 degrees?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:49.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能将沙发顺时针旋转三十度吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:54.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. What I'm saying is, Leonard might be different in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:54.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 我是说莱纳德比他们好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:57.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And obviously, my usual choices have not worked out so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然我之前的选择都错了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:02.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your last one worked out well for Koothrappali. He got a free iPod.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:02.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的前一个选择对库萨帕里不错 他捡到免费的随身听
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, glare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反光
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:07.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:07.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在另一方面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if things don't go well with Leonard, I risk losing a really good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我跟莱纳德交往失败 我会失去一个好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:12.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, he's not looking for a fling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:12.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜他肯定不是玩一玩就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:17.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's the kind that gets into a relationship for, like you would say, light-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:17.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他一谈恋爱就会是 像你说的 好几个光年
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would not say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会那么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:23.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one would say that. A light-year is a unit of distance, not time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:23.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有人会那么说 光年是距离单位 不是时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:25.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you for the clarification.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:25.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你的说明
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}备用地点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, people hear the word "year" and they think duration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家一听到“年”就以为那是时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:41.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Foot-pound has the same problem. That's a unit of work, not of weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:41.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尺磅也有相同的问题 那是力的单位 不是重量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:43.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:43.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's a common mistake. -Not the first one I've made today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是常见的错误 -不是我今天犯的第一个错误
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:48.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:48.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think this will be my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想这是我的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you have anything to say that has anything to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 对于我要谈的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:56.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with, you know, what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:56.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有什么话要说吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.36,0:14:59.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.36,0:14:59.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:01.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We might consider Schrödinger's cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:01.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以考虑薛定谔的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:05.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Schrödinger. Is that the woman in 2A?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:05.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛定谔是住在二楼的女士吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:06.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's Mrs. Grossinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:06.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那是葛洛辛格太太
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She doesn't have a cat, she has a Mexican hairless. Annoying little animal. Yip-yip-yip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没养猫 她养了只墨西哥无毛狗 讨厌的小动物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:11.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:11.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:14.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, you diverted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:14.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 你让我分心了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, in 1935, Erwin Schrödinger, in an attempt to explain...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之 1935年欧文薛定谔试图解释
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:22.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the Copenhagen interpretation of quantum physics, he proposed an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:22.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}量子物理学的哥本哈根诠释法 他提议做一项实验
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:26.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A cat is placed in a box with a sealed vial of poison...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:26.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将猫跟一管毒药放在箱子里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:28.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that will break open at a random time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:28.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}管子会随时破裂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, since no one knows when or if the poison has been released...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为没有人知道毒药何时被释放
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:38.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...until the box is opened, the cat can be thought of as both alive and dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:38.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非打开箱子 所以该猫可以视为同时死掉和活着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:44.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I don't get the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:44.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:48.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, of course you don't get it. I haven't made it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:48.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你当然听不懂 我还没说完
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:51.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to be psychic, there's no such thing--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:51.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非你有超能力 但是那是不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:53.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:53.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你到底要说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just like Schrödinger's cat, your potential relationship with Leonard...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像薛定谔的猫 你跟莱纳德的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:16:00.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...right now can be thought of as both good and bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:16:00.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以视为同时成功和失败
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:04.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is only by opening the box that you'll find out which it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:04.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有打开箱子你才会知道答案
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:08.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so you're saying I should go out with Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:08.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你是说我该跟莱纳德约会？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me start again. In 1935, Erwin Schrödinger....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再说一次 1935年薛定谔…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Two seats right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那边有两个位置
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}长寿石灰？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:32.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I think I've made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:32.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我想我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:35.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can see that. Unless you're running a marathon...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:35.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看得出来 除非你要跑马拉松
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:39.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...choosing both stuffing and mashed potatoes is a starch-filled redundancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:39.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同时挑了马铃薯跟马铃薯泥会导致淀粉过多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:41.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's about Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:41.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我是指佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A mistake involving Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟佩妮有关的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you'll have to narrow it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你得缩小范围
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think I can go out with her tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想今晚我不能跟她约会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.93,0:16:51.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.93,0:16:51.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就别去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Other people would say, "Why not?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其他人会说“为什么？”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:56.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Other people might be interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:56.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其他人会有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:17:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm gonna talk anyway. -I assumed you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:17:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我还是要谈 -我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:06.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now that I'm actually about to go out with Penny, I'm not excited, I'm nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:06.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我真的要跟佩妮约会 我不兴奋 我会想吐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:08.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then your meal choice is appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:08.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么你选对了餐点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Starch absorbs fluid...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}淀粉会吸收水
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which reduces the amount of vomit available for violent expulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}减少剧烈呕吐的量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Right. -You also made a grammatical mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 -你的语法也错了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:18.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said "nauseous" when you meant "nauseated."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:18.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的“想吐”是形容词 应该要用动词“吐”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请继续
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.00,0:17:24.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, this date is probably my one chance with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.00,0:17:24.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 这次约会可能是我跟佩妮在一起的唯一机会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:26.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happens if I blow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:26.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我搞砸了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:31.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if we accept your premise and also accept the highly improbable assumption...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:31.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们接受你的假设跟可能性不高的推论
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:34.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that Penny is the only woman in the world for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:34.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮是唯一适合你的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:37.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we can logically conclude that the result of blowing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:37.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在逻辑上我们可以说搞砸约会的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:40.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would be that you end up a lonely, bitter old man with no progeny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:40.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是你会变成独居老人 没有后代
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:43.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The image of any number of evil lighthouse keepers...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:43.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想到《史酷比》卡通里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from Scooby-Doo cartoons comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坏心灯塔管理员的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:47.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:47.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是在帮倒忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:49.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, what response on my part...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:49.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我应该要有什么反应
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:52.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would bring this conversation to a conclusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:52.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才能让这话题快速结束？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:54.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me whether or not to go through with the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:54.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我说我该不该去约会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:56.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Schrödinger's cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:56.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛定谔的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:59.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, that's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:59.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:02.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You sound surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:02.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你似乎很惊讶
